  'cutter-s-way': {"poster":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2f/CUTTERSW-00AA1-poster_hires.jpg","cast":["Jeff Bridges","John Heard","Lisa Eichhorn","Stephen Elliott","Nina van Pallandt","Billy Drago","Arthur Rosenberg","Francis X. McCarthy"],"directors":["Ivan Passer"],"synopsis":"Cutter's Way (ou La Blessure) est un film américain réalisé par Ivan Passer, sorti en 1981.","wikiUrl":"https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cutter's_Way","qid":"Q1146563"},
