  'import-export': {"poster":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6d/Import_Export_%282007%29_Film_Poster.jpg","cast":["Ekateryna Rak","Paul Hofmann","Georg Friedrich","Maria Hofstätter","Dirk Stermann","Petra Morzé","Thomas Nash","Brigitte Kren"],"directors":["Ulrich Seidl"],"synopsis":"Import/Export is an Austrian drama film by the director Ulrich Seidl from 2007. It was nominated for the Palme d'Or at the 2007 Cannes Film Festival and won the Grand Prix - Golden Apricot reward at the Yerevan International Film Festival. The film was shot in Vienna, Ukraine, Romania, the Czech Republic, and Slovakia from 2005 until May 2007 on 16mm film.","wikiUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Import%2FExport","qid":"Q253921"},
